"shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"8UPv1p9GW-BiZtQqUt8nOA","review_id":"7Du9hHsh5JaApWKNqG3lEQ","date":"2014-12-11T02:07:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9474118947982788,"text_excerpt":"Great local joint.They do oysters on the grill y'all right in front of the main dining area. It was producing the most heavenly aroma. Wait staff was super friendly and attentive without smothering you. Ok so I ordered the pasta bienville which was glorified chicken Alfredo. Yea I know such a cop out but I wanted pasta so I went with it. It was really tasty, such a pleasant surprise. The portion size was out of control but hey who doesn't love leftovers. My bf ordered the stuffed shrimp with a side of parsley potatoes. Omg the crabcake esq stuffing was AMAZING. Like they should consider making cab cakes with it and put it on the menu. His side of potatoes were pretty good nothing terribly..."},{"business_id":"8UPv1p9GW-BiZtQqUt8nOA","review_id":"ThxS3nz8PRrzNdVQKMBsrw","date":"2017-01-01T16:01:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9457532167434692,"text_excerpt":"I pass Neyow's on a weekly basis but never gave it a try until a coworker of mine said its a must go! She said the oysters are to die for and since my hubby is an oyster lover, we decided to dine here on a busy Friday night. As we were driving to Neyow's, I knew exactly when we stumbled upon it given the parties of people waiting outside the restaurant. They have valet service which we decided to bypass and just park our car ourselves but quickly gave up on that once circled the block. $5 for valet service was fair but the valet guy pretty much tried to talk us out of dining here! He asked if we had a reservation, which we did not, and then told us it would be an hour wait. Not really bel..."},{"business_id":"8UPv1p9GW-BiZtQqUt8nOA","review_id":"7ZWwVUsFeTxodTLUEDV6JQ","date":"2021-10-12T14:53:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9450565576553345,"text_excerpt":"This spot is by far my favorite place in NOLA so far. Funny story is, our Uber driver recommended it and said it was a MUST. Well, he definitely was spot-on with this place, because it was just amazing. I wish we had gone one last time before leaving. Our waitress was the sweetest -- she recommended the carrot soufflé as one of our sides; neither I or my boyfriend had ever tried it but she said it was amazing. And she was not wrong!! It was amazing, and it comes lightly dusted with powdered sugar. I wish I had tried this amazing dish sooner in my life, I honestly feel like I've been missing out! We both ended up getting the seafood combos, which was a great choice if you're divided on wha..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"8UPv1p9GW-BiZtQqUt8nOA","photo_id":"x_g9-Bx0CzRACitN2tR0-w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/x_g9-Bx0CzRACitN2tR0-w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8695753216743469},{"business_id":"8UPv1p9GW-BiZtQqUt8nOA","photo_id":"WQEHHisRLIhXJ3rnYP6x-Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WQEHHisRLIhXJ3rnYP6x-Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8629601001739502},{"business_id":"8UPv1p9GW-BiZtQqUt8nOA","photo_id":"GLf1-mT4cQ-k2mX_wUuquQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/GLf1-mT4cQ-k2mX_wUuquQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8538864254951477},{"business_id":"8UPv1p9GW-BiZtQqUt8nOA","photo_id":"w67vkMgp9pLqDT8CmHzGDA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/w67vkMgp9pLqDT8CmHzGDA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8057488799095154},{"business_id":"8UPv1p9GW-BiZtQqUt8nOA","photo_id":"Ev6dnChKWHXEH33ekfte-A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Ev6dnChKWHXEH33ekfte-A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7741247415542603}]},"notebook_case":null}
